Divex works magic and carries bombs, and travels with [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]], [[People/Althane/Henrik|Henrik]] and [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]] as [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. He can hide the company from sight, and keeps what he carries in his shadow. When the others find something enchanted, he is the one who says what it is.
